==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Krokorok|70}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*'''Light Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|VS|Bruno's Ursaring|85}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

